# No UI dividers

Do not use horizontal or vertical divider lines to separate content.

- No `border-top`, `border-bottom`, `border-left`, or `border-right` used only to split sections or columns
- No `<hr>` or pseudo-elements that draw separator lines between blocks
- Use spacing, typography hierarchy, and grid gap instead
- A single outline around a whole card or input is fine; lines *between* regions inside a page or card are not
